    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Research the prospect {{ $json.body.record.name }} from {{ $json.body.record.college }}.\n\nFirst, write a professional scouting report using this exact format:\nOVERVIEW: [3-4 sentences on skillsets, any storylines, and anything else notable about a player included in a scouting report]\nSTRENGTHS:\n• [Bullet 1]\n• [Bullet 2]\n• [Bullet 3]\nWEAKNESSES:\n• [Bullet 1]\n• [Bullet 2]\n• [Bullet 3]\n\nSecond, you MUST provide the specific data fields for this player. \n\nReturn your entire response as a single JSON object with these exact keys:\n\"bio\": (The full scouting report text from above)\n\"ht\": (Height, e.g., \"6'3\\\"\")\n\"wt\": (Weight, number only, e.g., 215)\n\"cls\": (College class, e.g., \"RSR\")\n\"slug\": (Name lowercase with dashes, e.g., \"joe-burrow\")\n\"hometown\": (City, State, e.g., \"Athens, OH\")\n\"position\": (Abbreviation, e.g., \"QB\", for certain positions only do IOL for interior lineman not exact position and DL for any defensive lineman along with EDGE for edge defedners. Each positions should be simpliest abbr)\n\"hs_stars\": (Recruit rating 0-5)\n\"pro_comp\": (NFL player name)\n\"college_logo_url\": (ESPN logo link, e.g., https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/ncaa/500/[ID].png)\n\nReturn ONLY the raw JSON. No extra text.",
